  "instance_name": "mental_deficient_slur",
  "label": "Mental Deficient Slur",
  "description": "A derogatory term used to demean individuals perceived as having low mental capacity or intellectual disability. It is a form of ableism that dehumanizes and stigmatizes people with cognitive impairments or those perceived as incompetent. This slur is often used to justify exclusion, discrimination, or violence against individuals with disabilities or those who are perceived as 'not smart enough'.",
